PROJECT: SMARTKEEP NOTES
TAGLINE: Your thoughts. Your space. Your notes.

ROLE:
Act as a senior Flutter architect, senior Android developer,
UI/UX designer, database engineer and QA engineer.

Build a complete, production-quality, 100% offline Android
notes application named "SmartKeep Notes".

TECHNOLOGY:
- Flutter framework
- Dart language
- Material 3
- Android native integration using Kotlin
- SQLite local database
- Provider state management
- Native Android home screen widgets

The application should feel like a premium, professionally
designed productivity app inspired by Google Keep, Apple Notes
and modern minimalist productivity applications.

Do not create a simple demo or prototype.

Deliver a complete, functional Android application with
all source files, native configurations, tests and build
automation.

==================================================
1. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
==================================================

Create a premium, minimalist, modern and highly interactive UI.

DESIGN PRINCIPLES:

1. Clean and uncluttered interface.
2. Generous whitespace.
3. Beautiful pastel note cards.
4. Consistent rounded corners.
5. Subtle shadows and borders.
6. Excellent typography and readability.
7. Smooth transitions and animations.
8. Consistent spacing across every screen.
9. Minimal unnecessary buttons.
10. Easy one-handed operation.

Avoid:
- Overcrowded interfaces.
- Excessive gradients.
- Excessive shadows.
- Too many accent colors.
- Large unnecessary headers.
- Complicated navigation.
- Cartoon-style illustrations.
- Outdated Android design patterns.

The application should look elegant and mature.

