11. BIOMETRIC SECURITY
==================================================

Use local_auth.

Implement:
- Fingerprint authentication.
- Face authentication where supported.
- PIN fallback.
- Auto-lock after inactivity.
- Optional individual note locks.

Use flutter_secure_storage for storing
sensitive encryption keys and security configuration.

IMPORTANT:
Do not treat biometric authentication alone
as database encryption.

If database encryption is enabled, use a compatible
SQLCipher-backed SQLite solution.

Ensure backup encryption is handled separately.

