==================================================
13. AUTOSAVE AND DATA INTEGRITY
==================================================

Create a dedicated autosave controller/service.

Requirements:

- 400ms debounce.
- Cancel previous pending debounce.
- Serialize writes safely.
- Prevent older saves overwriting newer changes.
- Save on application lifecycle pause.
- Flush before leaving the editor.
- Avoid unnecessary writes.
- Recover safely after application termination.
- Show save errors clearly.
- Never silently discard existing notes.

Test these scenarios:

1. User types and immediately presses back.
2. User types and force-closes the app.
3. User changes note color.
4. User checks an item.
5. User changes spreadsheet amounts.
6. User deletes a row.
7. User rapidly changes multiple fields.
8. Device restarts during editing.

